                                <p><p><strong><u>Shareek-e-karbala </u></strong></p>

<p>Shareeke karbala behan</p>

<p>Meri musafira behan</p>

<p>(Ya Hussain) x4</p>

<p>Rasan mein bandh chukka gala lo chal para who kafila, behan ghareeb nawha gar, sina pe jab parhi nazar, khamosh the shaheed sab, akhi ke hilrahe the lab, (sina pe ho to kya huwa) x2 tu hosla na haarna, (behan mein saath saath hun) x3</p>

